Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 01:15:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 034/106] go.mod: take sing-vmess from the podkop-engine fork
 (v0.2.8-pdk.1)

github.com/FiyeroT/sing-vmess v0.2.8-pdk.1 is the sing-vmess of this line plus one
change: under Vision in direct mode the connection reports the read side
replaceable, so the copy loop reads the raw TCP connection (splice, no
buffer held while idle) once the buffered remainder is out.
---
 go.mod | 2 ++
 go.sum | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
index b2ab87cab..4da65f79c 100644
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -198,3 +198,5 @@ require (
 	lukechampine.com/blake3 v1.3.0 // indirect
 	zombiezen.com/go/capnproto2 v2.18.2+incompatible // indirect
 )
+
+replace github.com/sagernet/sing-vmess => github.com/FiyeroT/sing-vmess v0.2.8-pdk.1
